# Project Structure

## lib/ directory

```
lib/
  server/              # import 'server-only' — never import from client code
    auth.ts            # getUserFromSession (shared across API routes)
    chat-utils.ts      # ChatMessage, foldSystemIntoUser (shared across chat routes)
    mongodb.ts
    crypto.ts
    prompts/           # YAML templates + builder.ts + renderer.ts
  client/              # All 'use client' code
    contexts/          # auth.tsx, settings.tsx, chat.tsx (barrel index.ts)
    story/             # context.tsx, streamStoryApi.ts, useStorySave.ts, useStoryPrefetch.ts, export.ts
  shared/              # Pure functions + types — importable from anywhere
    types.ts, characters.ts, agent.ts, useAutoSave.ts
    story/             # parser.ts, prompts.ts (constants only)
  models/              # Mongoose schemas
  tools/               # Tool registry
```

## components/ directory

```
components/
  roleplay/            # ChatInput, ChatWindow, ChatMessage, SettingsPanel, SidebarLeft, CharacterModal
  story/               # StoryWindow, StoryInput, StoryHeader, StorySettings, StorySidebar, SetupScreen
  shared/              # Header, ErrorToast, EditProfileModal, ConfirmDeleteModal, ApiKeySection
```

## Rules

- `lib/server/` has `import 'server-only'` — build error if imported from client
- `lib/client/` files use `'use client'` — React contexts, hooks, browser-only code
- `lib/shared/` has no side effects, no server/client dependencies
- Prompts are server-side only: client sends `promptParams`, API routes call `buildSystemPrompt()`
- API routes use `getUserFromSession` from `lib/server/auth.ts` (never define inline)
- API routes use `ChatMessage` / `foldSystemIntoUser` from `lib/server/chat-utils.ts` (never redefine)
- Reusable UI: `ConfirmDeleteModal`, `ApiKeySection` live in `components/shared/`
